
# Open Hepsiburada and login with <user> and <pass>

// Visit The Website And Accept the cookies
* Go To "websiteURL"
* Click On "cookieAcceptButtonId" by "selectorTypeId" on shadow root "cookieShadowRoot"

// Navigate The login Page
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "myAccountButtonId" then click
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "loginButtonId" then click

// Enter UserName & Password
* Find Failed Where "selectorTypeId" is "usernameFieldId" then fill with "username"
* Find Failed Where "selectorTypeId" is "passwordFieldId" then fill with "password"
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "loginSubmitButtonId" then click

// Verify that we logged in by checking the acctount button in header
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeXpath" is "loggedInAccountXpath"
* Assertion|Verify User Logged In Successfully